        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 8.1 - Basic Workweek and Workday",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                208,
                641,
                237
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    208.0
                ],
                [
                    641.0,
                    208.0
                ],
                [
                    641.0,
                    237.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    237.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Employer will establish specific work schedules at each MIARNG Activity necessary to accomplish the Employer's mission IAW 5 CFR §550.103, 5 CFR Part 610 and 32 USC 709.",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                264,
                1081,
                348
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    264.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    264.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    348.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    348.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Employer has the right to establish each Employee's workweek to ensure cost effective and timely compliance with operational requirements. Subject to these requirements, the Employer in establishing an Employee's work schedule shall take into consideration any personal hardship made known to the Employer by an Employee and shall make every reasonable effort to provide each Employee a work schedule fourteen (14) calendar days in advance of its effective date. Unless the mission requires otherwise, it is agreed that work schedules shall remain in effect for at least two pay periods.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                375,
                1079,
                600
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    135.0,
                    375.0
                ],
                [
                    1079.0,
                    375.0
                ],
                [
                    1079.0,
                    600.0
                ],
                [
                    135.0,
                    600.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Subject to mission requirements, Management approval, and based on input from the Partnership Council (where applicable), Employees may request one of the following work schedule options:",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                625,
                1049,
                709
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
