            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. When an Employer knows in advance of an administrative workweek that the specific days and/or hours of a day actually required of an Employee in that administrative workweek will differ from those required in the current administrative workweek, he or she shall reschedule the Employee's regularly scheduled administrative workweek to correspond with those specific days and hours. The Employer shall inform the Employee of the change, and he or she shall record the change on the Employee's time card or other agency document for recording work.",
            "block_bbox": [
                132,
                903,
                1029,
                1100
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    132.0,
                    903.0
                ],
                [
                    1029.0,
                    903.0
                ],
                [
                    1029.0,
                    1100.0
                ],
                [
                    132.0,
                    1100.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. If it is determined that the Employer should have scheduled a period of work as part of the Employee's regularly scheduled administrative workweek and failed to do so in accordance with paragraph four (4), the Employee shall be entitled to the payment of premium pay for that period of work as regularly scheduled work. In this regard, it must be determined that the Employer:",
            "block_bbox": [
                132,
                1125,
                1074,
                1266
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    132.0,
                    1125.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    1125.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    1266.0
                ],
                [
                    132.0,
                    1266.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Had knowledge of the specific days and hours of the work requirement in advance of the administrative workweek, and",
            "block_bbox": [
                132,
                1292,
                1084,
                1348
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
